WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:04.660
Ichiro! I wrote my New Year's cards,
 and now I'll go send them!

00:04.660 --> 00:06.970
Hold on. Send mine out, too.

00:06.970 --> 00:07.740
Sure!

00:13.720 --> 00:15.360
G-Good morning.

00:15.690 --> 00:18.740
<i>Here comes that Christmas memory again!</i>

00:19.310 --> 00:21.130
Good morning.

00:21.130 --> 00:22.540
Um...

00:22.540 --> 00:23.910
Did something happen?

00:23.910 --> 00:26.760
Yes, I heard from the island yesterday.

00:27.240 --> 00:30.760
Did they maybe figure out 
how to annul the pact?

00:30.760 --> 00:33.760
No, my mother contacted me.

00:34.660 --> 00:36.260
What did she say?

00:36.630 --> 00:40.210
I was told they're looking 
forward to my return.

00:40.210 --> 00:45.320
But if I go back now, I don't know when 
I'd next be able to leave the island,

00:45.320 --> 00:48.000
so I told her I won't be 
going back for a while.

00:48.370 --> 00:49.740
Okay.

00:50.120 --> 00:54.690
Well, I'm sorry there's nothing 
to pass along about the pact.

00:54.690 --> 00:59.290
I've tasked someone I trust with that, 
so please let them keep investigating.

00:59.290 --> 01:01.080
Got it, no problem.

01:01.080 --> 01:02.920
No need to feel so down about it.

01:03.200 --> 01:05.670
W-Want to prepare for the new year together?

01:06.610 --> 01:07.570
Sure!

01:15.340 --> 01:18.470
<b>Ornamental Shimenawa</b>

01:22.470 --> 01:26.730
Red and White

01:22.470 --> 01:26.730
Song Tournament

01:26.720 --> 01:29.220
Kotatsu are the greatest.

01:31.060 --> 01:34.490
What other plans are there for New Year's?

01:34.490 --> 01:37.730
Plans? There are no such things.

01:38.170 --> 01:40.420
We'll eat New Year's food and lie around,

01:40.420 --> 01:43.060
then eat more New Year's food 
and lie around some more.

01:43.060 --> 01:45.370
They call that the New Year's Staycation.

01:46.540 --> 01:48.870
Let's do a New Year's shrine visit!

01:48.920 --> 01:52.630
<b>Neyasu Shrine</b>

01:48.920 --> 01:52.630
<b>Neyasu Shrine</b>

01:51.990 --> 01:55.100
Happy New Year!

01:52.630 --> 01:56.510
<b>Frankfurters</b>

01:52.630 --> 01:56.510
<b>Chocolate Bananas</b>

02:05.020 --> 02:10.900
<b>Lottery</b>

02:05.760 --> 02:07.720
Let's try our luck!

02:08.660 --> 02:10.890
Ichiro, don't you have tickets saved up?

02:10.890 --> 02:11.800
Yep.

02:10.900 --> 02:13.880
<b>Frankfurters</b>

02:11.210 --> 02:14.140
<b>Taiyaki</b>

02:12.310 --> 02:14.150
You get one too, Goshiki-san.

02:14.150 --> 02:16.280
<b>Lottery ticket</b>

02:14.150 --> 02:16.280
<b>Lottery ticket</b>

02:14.150 --> 02:16.280
Good from 1/1 to 1/3

02:15.100 --> 02:18.240
Well then, thank you!

02:18.240 --> 02:20.770
I want the big teddy bear!

02:21.380 --> 02:22.430
Teddy...

02:22.430 --> 02:23.660
Teddy.

02:23.660 --> 02:24.780
It's huge...

02:28.790 --> 02:30.040
Fifth Prize

02:31.290 --> 02:32.540
Fifth Prize

02:31.290 --> 02:32.540
Fifth Prize

02:34.290 --> 02:35.490
Fifth Prize

02:34.290 --> 02:35.530
Fifth Prize

02:35.420 --> 02:37.050
Fifth Prize

02:37.060 --> 02:39.290
Shio-chan, win the teddy!

02:39.290 --> 02:41.680
Okay, you bet I will.

02:42.110 --> 02:44.500
You don't need to get so worked up.

02:50.930 --> 02:53.310
It's the grand prize!

02:53.310 --> 02:56.200
Family tickets for an 
overnight hot spring trip!

02:56.530 --> 02:59.080
Wow! You nailed it!

02:59.080 --> 03:00.660
What <i>luck</i>.

03:00.660 --> 03:02.190
But, the teddy...

03:02.190 --> 03:04.350
Nah, Shio-chan, you're awesome!

03:04.350 --> 03:05.570
Awesome!

03:05.570 --> 03:09.450
These can only be used 
this month, so go soon!

03:05.580 --> 03:09.460
Grand Prize

03:11.270 --> 03:14.210
We're all on winter vacation, aren't we?

03:14.210 --> 03:18.710
Grand Prize

03:14.860 --> 03:18.110
Let's take a hot spring trip together!

03:18.110 --> 03:21.030
H-Hot spring trip?!

03:33.190 --> 03:40.490
Looks like it started before I knew it

03:41.240 --> 03:46.280
Thanks to you, I'm all smiles

03:48.200 --> 03:56.250
The usual townscape lends 
charm to the two of us

03:56.250 --> 04:01.760
Funny how it looks like a starry sky

04:05.510 --> 04:07.600
Suddenly buying flowers

04:07.600 --> 04:09.600
Standing around in the kitchen

04:09.600 --> 04:12.810
Sending a photo, because 
the setting sun is pretty

04:12.810 --> 04:17.360
Trying to spend as much 
time with you as I can

04:17.360 --> 04:20.360
This is all new for me

04:22.240 --> 04:27.910
I hope tomorrow is like today

04:28.240 --> 04:34.460
I've never felt this way before

04:34.460 --> 04:40.050
We'll go on a date this weekend if possible

04:40.710 --> 04:45.970
But it's fine if we stay home

04:47.220 --> 04:50.430
I can't wait to see you

04:53.020 --> 04:58.020
<b><b>Episode 9</b></b>

