05:40.060 --> 05:41.150
A lovely idea!

05:44.000 --> 05:46.570
Are you okay looking after Machi?

05:46.570 --> 05:47.650
Of course!

05:48.000 --> 05:49.330
It'll be great.

05:49.330 --> 05:50.410
Yeah!

05:50.970 --> 05:52.420
See you later, then.

05:58.180 --> 06:00.210
The water's great!

06:02.960 --> 06:04.660
Everyone's naked.

06:05.150 --> 06:09.100
Shio-chan! Don't go staring 
at strangers in here!

06:09.100 --> 06:11.790
You're right. I'm sorry.

06:11.790 --> 06:14.090
It's my first time bathing with others.

06:14.340 --> 06:19.090
No problem! Today I'll teach 
you about hot spring manners!

06:19.300 --> 06:21.390
You're so dependable!

06:28.360 --> 06:32.160
