06:28.910 --> 06:31.090
Open-air baths are lovely!

06:36.120 --> 06:37.880
Hey, no swimming!

06:39.180 --> 06:41.590
<i>I had to leave Machi in her care.</i>

06:41.590 --> 06:43.870
<i>I wonder if she's looking after her.</i>

06:44.920 --> 06:47.130
That was a great bath.

06:49.190 --> 06:52.140
Oh, you guys had already gotten out.

06:52.140 --> 06:53.270
